            </span>
            <span>Cornerstone<small>Property Management</small></span>
          </a>
          <p>Full-service residential property management for owners and residents across Central Texas.</p>
          <ul class="footer-contact">
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.13.96.36 1.9.7 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.9.34 1.85.57 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92Z"/></svg> <a href="tel:+15125550142">(512) 555-0142</a></li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="m22 7-10 5L2 7"/></svg> <a href="mailto:hello@cornerstonepm.example">hello@cornerstonepm.example</a></li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0Z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg> 640 Congress Ave, Suite 300, Austin, TX</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="footer-col">
          <h4>For owners</h4>
          <ul>
            <li><a href="#analysis">Free rental analysis</a></li>
            <li><a href="#owner-portal">Owner login</a></li>
            <li><a href="#services">Management services</a></li>
            <li><a href="#faq">Owner FAQ</a></li>
            <li><a href="#how">How it works</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="footer-col">
          <h4>For renters</h4>
          <ul>
            <li><a href="properties.html">Available rentals</a></li>
            <li><a href="#pay-rent">Pay rent online</a></li>
            <li><a href="#maintenance">Maintenance request</a></li>
            <li><a href="properties.html">Apply now</a></li>
            <li><a href="#owners-renters">Resident benefits</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="footer-maint" id="maintenance">
          <h4>Need a repair?</h4>
          <p>Current residents can submit a maintenance request anytime — emergencies are answered 24/7.</p>
          <a class="btn btn-gold btn-sm btn-block" href="#maintenance">Submit a maintenance request</a>
          <div class="areas-served" aria-label="Areas served">
            <span>Austin</span><span>Round Rock</span><span>Cedar Park</span><span>Pflugerville</span><span>Georgetown</span><span>Leander</span>
